"""Live native-concurrency C2-C8 release gate. See README.md beside this file.

The driver is the operational layer for the already-integrated offline
qualifier (`qwen4_native_concurrency_probe.py`) and matrix sealer
(`qwen4_native_concurrency_matrix.py`). It launches one fresh in-container
server process per arm, binds that process to the release image, runs the
probe's request plan and validators against it, seals the plain nine-arm
matrix with the untouched sealer, runs the native-K5 nine-arm matrix under the
K5 state contract, and emits the wrapper's `native-concurrency-c2-c8` evidence.
"""

